  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the recent addition of the OnVariableChange event, UdonGraph users can now react to when the variable is updated. If the variable with a change callback has an initial value that is not the default for that type, the old value is incorrect for the first call of the change event. \nVRChat build 1114\nVRCSDK3 2021.07.13.13.39\nSee screenshot for example graph. It defines a bool variable with the default value to true. On Interact flips its value. The change callback will then set the enabled state of two gameobjects. The first call will always disable both objects as _old_value is initialized to false instead of true.",
